---
description: Efficient task verification
alwaysApply: true
---

For normal TASKs:

- Run targeted unit tests.
- Run targeted affected-module integration tests when applicable.
- Run typecheck, lint, format check, and build once near completion.
- Do not run the full integration suite after every TASK.
- Run full integration only at phase/checkpoint/release boundaries, after critical shared-core changes, or when specifically required.
- Debug failures with targeted tests; do not repeatedly rerun the full suite.
- Report only checks actually executed.